: 
: Also, what is a wand of undead turning good for?   I've never been
: able to get any percievable effect from one.

"Turning undead" means to cause undead monsters (mummies, vampires,
wraiths, liches (?), zombies) to flee.  Priests can turn undead
creatures, but doing so is like a prayer, not to be done often.  The
wand will also make a corpse into a living creature again.  In D&D,
turning a low level monster sometimes destroys them.  I don't know if its
possible in Nethack.

